        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 126841,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ponieważ przypisanie do samej siebie jest potężnym narzędziem do tworzenia programów, poznajmy kilka operatorów, które pomagają szybciej pisać kod.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 126842,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wiemy, że możemy dodać <code>1</code> do zmiennej, zapisując nazwę zmiennej. W tym przypadku <code>likes</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" likes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"likes = likes + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(likes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"27\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>likes</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "+= operator",
            "id": 126843,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zamiast ponownie wpisywać nazwę zmiennej, możemy użyć operatora <code>+=</code>, aby zwiększyć liczbę za pomocą <code>likes += 1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" likes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"likes += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(likes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>likes</code>, następnie <code>+=</code> i na końcu <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "-= operator",
            "id": 126844,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aby odjąć wartość od zmiennej, używamy operatora <code>-=</code>, tak jak tutaj, gdzie zmniejszamy <code>likes</code> o <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" likes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"likes -= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(likes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"22\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>-=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: += operator",
            "id": 126847,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" marbles = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"marbles += \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(marbles)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"8\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>8</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>6</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>8</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: -= operator",
            "id": 126848,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jakiego operatora używamy do odejmowania liczby od wartości zmiennej?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>-=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>+=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>-=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing numbers",
            "id": 126849,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Które wyrażenie dodaje jeden do wartości zmiennej?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>+= 1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>-= 1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>+= 1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Decrementing numbers",
            "id": 126850,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" speed = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed -= \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(speed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"199\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>199</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>201</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>199</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: += operator",
            "id": 126851,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj 10 do wartości zmiennej za pomocą operatora <code>+=</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" yards = \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"yards += \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(yards)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"90\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>yards</code>, następnie <code>+</code>, a potem <code>=</code>, <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: -= operator",
            "id": 126852,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Odejmij 200 od wartości zmiennej za pomocą operatora <code>-=</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" account = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"account -= \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(account)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"33\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"800\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>-=</code>, a następnie <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Incrementing numbers",
            "id": 126853,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zwiększ wartość zmiennej <code>wallet</code> o jeden.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wallet = \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"14\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>wallet</code>, następnie <code>+=</code> i na końcu <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Decrementing numbers",
            "id": 126854,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Użyj wyrażenia dekrementacji <code>-= 1</code>, aby zmniejszyć wartość wallet o jeden.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"var\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wallet = \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet -= \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"27\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"12\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>wallet -= 1</code>.</p></body></html>"
